{"type": "gmiss", "vol": "V10", "n": 1, "severity": "major", "items": ["V10-0340", "V10-0204"], "where": "V10 (whole volume: §2.13 FieldDrivers/WhyFamily, §3.9 providers, §2.10 familyWords, §3.3 lexicon) vs g item 111", "claim": "Item 111 names V10 for 'the explanations': the oasis (a spring-fed pond with its grove and irrigated gardens, from a dossier's oasis_water or the arid row's chance, or T2's spring flag), the arid WATER PULL on growth and the prosperity field's water term ('the wealthy hold the land nearest the water'), wells placed by yield, and (c)'s climate cell turning item 102's sunlight term to zero or toward shade in hot arid rows. V10 has no oasis explanation (default provider row or section), no words for a water driver (why.driver / familyWords), no lexicon row ('oasis', 'desert town'), no creation-mode handling ('a desert town by an oasis' → intend water + ground lake with spring) and no critique or test; grep 'oasis', 'water pull', 'water term': 0 hits.", "hint": "Write V10's part at build depth: the lexicon rows (oasis, desert, arid), the ground encoder's spring flag on op 'lake', the prosperity provider's water term words and the sun term's arid reading, an oasis fact with its DR row when dossier-bound, an eval case and a T-V10 bar; cite item 111 (a)-(c)."}
